{"text":"kuruntokai","n":173,"lines":["பொன்னேர் ஆவிரைப் புதுமலர் மிடைந்த","பன்னூல் மாலைப் பனைபடு கலிமாப்","பூண்மணி கறங்க வேறி நாணட்","டழிபடர் உண்ணோய் வழிவழி சிறப்ப","இன்னள் செய்த திதுவென முன்னின்","றவள் பழி நுவலு மிவ்வூர்","ஆங்குணர்ந் தமையினீங் கேகுமா றுளெனே"],"tr":["poṉṉēr āviraip putumalar miṭainta","paṉṉūl mālaip paṉaipaṭu kalimāp","pūṇmaṇi kaṟaṅka vēṟi nāṇaṭ","ṭaḻipaṭar uṇṇōy vaḻivaḻi ciṟappa","iṉṉaḷ ceyta tituveṉa muṉṉiṉ","ṟavaḷ paḻi nuvalu mivvūr","āṅkuṇarn tamaiyiṉīṅ kēkumā ṟuḷeṉē"],"colophon":{"tinai":"kuṟiñci","tinai_ta":"குறிஞ்சி","speaker_ta":"தலைவன் கூற்று","poet_ta":"மதுரைக் காஞ்சிப்புலவன்","speaker_en":"the hero (talaivaṉ)","poet_tr":"Maturaik Kāñcippulavaṉ"},"scan":{"meter":"nilaimaṇṭila āciriyappā","ok":true,"checks":[{"name":"lines","ok":true,"detail":"7 lines"},{"name":"feet per line","ok":true,"detail":"7×4 feet"},{"name":"foot types","ok":true,"detail":"iyaṟcīr 26, other 2"},{"name":"linkage","ok":true,"detail":"āciriyattaḷai 17, veṇṭaḷai 8, ? 2"},{"name":"ending","ok":true,"detail":"ends on ஏ"}],"ending":"ஏ","lines":[[{"text":"பொன்னேர்","tr":"poṉṉēr","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"பொன்","tr":"poṉ"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"னேர்","tr":"ṉēr"}]},{"text":"ஆவிரைப்","tr":"āviraip","foot":"kūviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"ஆ","tr":"ā"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"விரைப்","tr":"viraip"}]},{"text":"புதுமலர்","tr":"putumalar","foot":"karuviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"புது","tr":"putu"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"மலர்","tr":"malar"}]},{"text":"மிடைந்த","tr":"miṭainta","foot":"puḷimā","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"மிடைந்","tr":"miṭain"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"த","tr":"ta"}]}],[{"text":"பன்னூல்","tr":"paṉṉūl","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"பன்","tr":"paṉ"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"னூல்","tr":"ṉūl"}]},{"text":"மாலைப்","tr":"mālaip","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"மா","tr":"mā"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"லைப்","tr":"laip"}]},{"text":"பனைபடு","tr":"paṉaipaṭu","foot":"karuviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"பனை","tr":"paṉai"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"படு","tr":"paṭu"}]},{"text":"கலிமாப்","tr":"kalimāp","foot":"puḷimā","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"கலி","tr":"kali"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"மாப்","tr":"māp"}]}],[{"text":"பூண்மணி","tr":"pūṇmaṇi","foot":"kūviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"பூண்","tr":"pūṇ"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"மணி","tr":"maṇi"}]},{"text":"கறங்க","tr":"kaṟaṅka","foot":"puḷimā","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"கறங்","tr":"kaṟaṅ"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"க","tr":"ka"}]},{"text":"வேறி","tr":"vēṟi","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"வே","tr":"vē"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"றி","tr":"ṟi"}]},{"text":"நாணட்","tr":"nāṇaṭ","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"நா","tr":"nā"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"ணட்","tr":"ṇaṭ"}]}],[{"text":"டழிபடர்","tr":"ṭaḻipaṭar","foot":"karuviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"டழி","tr":"ṭaḻi"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"படர்","tr":"paṭar"}]},{"text":"உண்ணோய்","tr":"uṇṇōy","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"உண்","tr":"uṇ"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"ணோய்","tr":"ṇōy"}]},{"text":"வழிவழி","tr":"vaḻivaḻi","foot":"karuviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"வழி","tr":"vaḻi"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"வழி","tr":"vaḻi"}]},{"text":"சிறப்ப","tr":"ciṟappa","foot":"puḷimā","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"சிறப்","tr":"ciṟap"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"ப","tr":"pa"}]}],[{"text":"இன்னள்","tr":"iṉṉaḷ","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"இன்","tr":"iṉ"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"னள்","tr":"ṉaḷ"}]},{"text":"செய்த","tr":"ceyta","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"செய்","tr":"cey"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"த","tr":"ta"}]},{"text":"திதுவென","tr":"tituveṉa","foot":"karuviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"திது","tr":"titu"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"வென","tr":"veṉa"}]},{"text":"முன்னின்","tr":"muṉṉiṉ","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"முன்","tr":"muṉ"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"னின்","tr":"ṉiṉ"}]}],[{"text":"றவள்","tr":"ṟavaḷ","foot":"malar","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"றவள்","tr":"ṟavaḷ"}]},{"text":"பழி","tr":"paḻi","foot":"malar","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"பழி","tr":"paḻi"}]},{"text":"நுவலு","tr":"nuvalu","foot":"puḷimā","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"நுவ","tr":"nuva"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"லு","tr":"lu"}]},{"text":"மிவ்வூர்","tr":"mivvūr","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"மிவ்","tr":"miv"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"வூர்","tr":"vūr"}]}],[{"text":"ஆங்குணர்ந்","tr":"āṅkuṇarn","foot":"kūviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"ஆங்","tr":"āṅ"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"குணர்ந்","tr":"kuṇarn"}]},{"text":"தமையினீங்","tr":"tamaiyiṉīṅ","foot":"karuviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"தமை","tr":"tamai"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"யினீங்","tr":"yiṉīṅ"}]},{"text":"கேகுமா","tr":"kēkumā","foot":"kūviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"கே","tr":"kē"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"குமா","tr":"kumā"}]},{"text":"றுளெனே","tr":"ṟuḷeṉē","foot":"puḷimā","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"றுளெ","tr":"ṟuḷe"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"னே","tr":"ṉē"}]}]]},"ai":{"lines":[{"words":[{"surface":"பொன்னேர்","parts":[{"text":"பொன்","lemma":"poṉ","gloss":"gold"},{"text":"ஏர்","lemma":"ēr","gloss":"resembling"}],"gloss":"resembling gold"},{"surface":"ஆவிரை","parts":[{"text":"ஆவிரை","lemma":"āvirai","gloss":"tanner's cassia"}],"gloss":"tanner's cassia flowers"},{"surface":"புதுமலர்","parts":[{"text":"புதுமை","lemma":"putumai","gloss":"fresh"},{"text":"மலர்","lemma":"malar","gloss":"flower"}],"gloss":"fresh flowers"},{"surface":"மிடைந்த","parts":[{"text":"மிடைந்த","lemma":"miṭai","gloss":"closely packed"}],"gloss":"closely packed"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"பன்னூல்","parts":[{"text":"பன்னூல்","lemma":"பன்னூல்","gloss":"many-threaded"}],"gloss":"many-threaded","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"மாலை","parts":[{"text":"மாலை","lemma":"mālai","gloss":"garland"}],"gloss":"garland"},{"surface":"பனைபடு","parts":[{"text":"பனை","lemma":"paṉai","gloss":"palmyra"},{"text":"படு","lemma":"paṭu","gloss":"made of"}],"gloss":"made of palmyra"},{"surface":"கலிமா","parts":[{"text":"கலி","lemma":"kali","gloss":"spirited"},{"text":"மா","lemma":"mā","gloss":"horse"}],"gloss":"spirited horse"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"பூண்மணி","parts":[{"text":"பூண்மணி","lemma":"பூண்மணி","gloss":""}],"gloss":"","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"கறங்க","parts":[{"text":"கறங்க","lemma":"கறங்க","gloss":""}],"gloss":"","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"வேறி","parts":[{"text":"வேறி","lemma":"வேறி","gloss":""}],"gloss":"","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"நாணட்","parts":[{"text":"நாணட்","lemma":"நாணட்","gloss":""}],"gloss":"","split_unverified":true}],"as_printed":true},{"words":[{"surface":"டழிபடர்","parts":[{"text":"டழிபடர்","lemma":"டழிபடர்","gloss":""}],"gloss":"","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"உண்ணோய்","parts":[{"text":"உண்ணோய்","lemma":"உண்ணோய்","gloss":""}],"gloss":"","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"வழிவழி","parts":[{"text":"வழிவழி","lemma":"வழிவழி","gloss":""}],"gloss":"","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"சிறப்ப","parts":[{"text":"சிறப்ப","lemma":"சிறப்ப","gloss":""}],"gloss":"","split_unverified":true}],"as_printed":true},{"words":[{"surface":"இன்னள்","parts":[{"text":"இன்னள்","lemma":"இன்னள்","gloss":""}],"gloss":"","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"செய்த","parts":[{"text":"செய்த","lemma":"செய்த","gloss":""}],"gloss":"","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"திதுவென","parts":[{"text":"திதுவென","lemma":"திதுவென","gloss":""}],"gloss":"","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"முன்னின்","parts":[{"text":"முன்னின்","lemma":"முன்னின்","gloss":""}],"gloss":"","split_unverified":true}],"as_printed":true},{"words":[{"surface":"றவள்","parts":[{"text":"றவள்","lemma":"றவள்","gloss":""}],"gloss":"","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"பழி","parts":[{"text":"பழி","lemma":"பழி","gloss":""}],"gloss":"","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"நுவலு","parts":[{"text":"நுவலு","lemma":"நுவலு","gloss":""}],"gloss":"","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"மிவ்வூர்","parts":[{"text":"மிவ்வூர்","lemma":"மிவ்வூர்","gloss":""}],"gloss":"","split_unverified":true}],"as_printed":true},{"words":[{"surface":"ஆங்கு","parts":[{"text":"ஆங்கு","lemma":"āṅku","gloss":"there"}],"gloss":"there"},{"surface":"உணர்ந்தமையின்","parts":[{"text":"உணர்ந்தமையின்","lemma":"உணர்ந்தமையின்","gloss":"because of realizing"}],"gloss":"because of realizing","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"ஈங்கு","parts":[{"text":"ஈங்கு","lemma":"īṅku","gloss":"here"}],"gloss":"here"},{"surface":"ஏகும்","parts":[{"text":"ஏகும்","lemma":"ēku","gloss":"going"}],"gloss":"going"},{"surface":"ஆறு","parts":[{"text":"ஆறு","lemma":"āṟu","gloss":"way"}],"gloss":"way"},{"surface":"உளென்","parts":[{"text":"உள்","lemma":"uḷ","gloss":"be/have"},{"text":"என்","lemma":"eṉ","gloss":"I"}],"gloss":"I have"},{"surface":"ஏ","parts":[{"text":"ஏ","lemma":"ē","gloss":"emphasis"}],"gloss":"indeed"}]}],"literal":"Fresh flowers of gold-like tanner's cassia closely packed / in a garland of many threads, on a spirited horse made of palmyra / adorned bells ringing, having mounted, modesty having destroyed / ruining affliction and inner pain continuously to increase / 'This woman did this' saying, standing in front / she, blame speaks, this village / there because of realizing, here to go a way I have indeed.","translation":"I will mount the spirited horse made of palmyra stems, woven with many-threaded garlands of fresh, gold-like tanner's cassia flowers, while its adorned bells ring. Casting aside my modesty, as my ruining affliction and inner pain grow more and more, I will go. Let this village stand before me and slander her, saying, 'She is the one who caused this!' Since they will realize my love there, I have a way to go from here.","modern":"பொன்னைப் போன்ற ஆவிரையின் புதிய மலர்கள் நெருங்கிய பல நூல்களால் தொடுக்கப்பட்ட மாலையை அணிந்த, பனை மடலால் செய்யப்பட்ட குதிரையின் மேல், கட்டப்பட்ட மணிகள் ஒலிக்க ஏறி, எனது நாணத்தை ஒழித்து, நெஞ்சை அழிக்கும் துன்பமும் உள்நோயும் மேலும் மேலும் வளர, 'இவள்தான் எனக்கு இதனைச் செய்தாள்' என்று இவ்வூர் மக்கள் என் முன்னின்று அவளைப் பழித்துப் பேசட்டும். அவ்வாறு அவர்கள் என் காதலை உணர்ந்து கொள்வார்கள் என்பதால், நான் இங்கிருந்து செல்வதற்கான வழி எனக்கு உண்டாயிற்று.","explanation":"This poem belongs to the Kuriñci tiṇai (mountainous landscape) and is spoken by the hero. The hero is deeply in love with the heroine, but her family or the village has not yet consented to their union. In classical Tamil love poetry, when a lover's grief becomes unbearable, he threatens to perform maṭalēṟutal—mounting a mock horse made of rough palmyra stems decorated with tanner's cassia flowers, and riding it through the village to publicize his love. By doing this, he casts away his modesty to let his inner pain be known. He welcomes the village's gossip and blame directed at the heroine, because once the village realizes the depth of his love, it will pave the way for their union.","model":"gemini-3.5-flash"}}